msgid "About Board-Gamers.com - For Clubs & Associations"
msgstr "Informazioni su Board-Gamers.com - Per Club e Associazioni"

msgid ""
"Discover why board game clubs and associations choose Board-Gamers.com: free "
"forever, open source, member management, tables, rankings and more."
